"color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">|</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">diff</span><span> - server/keys/public_key.pem</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">If it outputs <strong>nothing</strong>, the keys match perfectly. If it shows differences, that's the problem.</p>
