          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md backdrop-blur-md _fill_10ocf_9 _ghost_10ocf_96" type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="text-text-500 font-small p-3.5 pb-0">python</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-python" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span><span>firmware_hash </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">=</span><span> hashlib</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>sha256</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span>firmware_data</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>digest</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span>  </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># you pre-hash it</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span>signature </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">=</span><span> private_key</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>sign</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    firmware_hash</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">,</span><span>       </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># passing the hash</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    padding</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>PKCS1v15</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">,</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    hashes</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>SHA256</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span>      </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># then telling it to hash AGAIN</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You're <strong>double-hashing</strong> — you manually compute SHA-256 first, then pass that hash to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.sign()</code> which hashes it a second time internally. So you're actually signing <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">SHA256(SHA256(firmware))</code>.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Ayaan's ESP32 is correctly doing <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">SHA256(firmware)</code> once and verifying against that — so it will always fail.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Fix — change <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">sign_firmware.py</code> to this:</strong></p>
<div role="group" aria-label="python code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
