et the library handle hashing</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>signature </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">=</span><span> private_key</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span><span>sign</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span>
