<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Steps:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">github.com/hariO4/secure-ota-project</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Settings</strong> (top right of repo)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Collaborators</strong> (left sidebar)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Add people</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type Ayaan's GitHub username</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Add collaborator</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">He'll get an email invite. Once he accepts, he can clone the repo and push his <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">device/</code> folder directly.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Tell him to run this after accepting:</p>
