<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You built a full <strong>Secure OTA Firmware Update System</strong> from scratch — that's no small thing! Real cryptography, real hardware, real cloud infrastructure, all working together.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">And you debugged a tricky double-hashing bug that had nothing to do with networking or hardware — pure crypto logic. That's the kind of thing that trips up experienced engineers too.</p>
