to_400px] pb-8 -mb-8 print:[content-visibility:visible]"><div data-test-render-count="2"><div class="contents"><div class="mb-1 mt-6 group"><h2 class="sr-only select-none">You said: OKAY, now i need to study deeply on what i did(not ayaan's now), so teach me from start what we did.</h2><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1"><div data-user-message-bubble="true" class="group relative inline-flex gap-2 bg-bg-300 rounded-xl pl-2.5 py-2.5 break-words text-text-100 transition-all max-w-[75ch] flex-col !px-4 max-w-[85%]" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 relative"><div class="flex-1"><div data-testid="user-message" class="font-large !font-user-message py-0.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 relative [&amp;_ul]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ol]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ul]:pl-8 [&amp;_ol]:pl-8" style="max-height: none; overflow: hidden; position: relative;"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">OKAY, now i need to study deeply on what i did(not ayaan's now), so teach me from start what we did. EVERYTHING, if its tooo long, you can make pdf,ppt or anything or just in the chat itself. teach me what we did. whats hiveMQ, what's gitrepo. the public key, private ey, why we protected it, getignore, things we did on terminal,git,hivemq and vs code. explain the programs used in both bash and python. etc etc . like tell me details, from scartch, I gotta teach ayaan after learning these</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center mr-2">7 Jun</span><div class="flex items-center"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none round